WEBVTT

00:10:58.320 --> 00:11:02.536
And I say that because
we live in a society

00:11:02.560 --> 00:11:05.216
that's so obsessed with black death.

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:09.816
We have images of our death
on the TV screen,

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:11.736
on our Twitter timelines,

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:14.296
on our Facebook timelines,

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:17.720
but what if instead
we imagine black life?

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:21.696
We imagine black people
living and thriving.

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:23.176
And that --

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:24.480
that inspires me.

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:31.080
OT: What inspires me
these days are immigrants.